  m_text: This code creates a bullet when the player shoots. First, it checks that
    the shoot point and bullet prefab exist. Then it spawns a bullet at the shoot
    point, gets its Rigidbody2D, and gives it a velocity. This makes the bullet move
    to the right across the screen.
